2026-11-09 04:45:00Z  2026-11-09 04:50:00Z  INFY      -0.82         1             1610.75     1598.20   -0.78             true       negative sentiment (-0.82) with price drop (-0.78%)
2026-11-09 04:45:00Z  2026-11-09 04:50:00Z  TCS        null         0             3980.00     3980.00    0.00             false      null
